          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 150063,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lass die <code>Enemy</code>-Klasse von der <code>GameObject</code>-Klasse erben.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Extends\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"103\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameObject\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(x, y) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".x = x;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".y = y;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameObject\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>class</code>, gefolgt von <code>Enemy</code> und schließlich <code>extends</code>, <code>GameObject</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 150064,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Erstelle ein Objekt aus der <code>Enemy</code>-Klasse und zeige es an.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"GameObject\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"112\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"119\" /><option startIndex=\"120\" endIndex=\"125\" /><option startIndex=\"126\" endIndex=\"137\" /><option startIndex=\"137\" endIndex=\"138\" /><option startIndex=\"151\" endIndex=\"157\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameObject\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(x, y) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".x = x;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".y = y;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameObject\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemy1);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>const</code>, gefolgt von <code>enemy1</code> und schließlich <code>= new</code>, <code>Enemy(3, 4)</code>, <code>;</code>, <code>enemy1</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 150065,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Stelle sicher, dass die <code>Player</code>-Klasse die Eigenschaften ihrer Superklasse <code>GameObject</code> erbt.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Enemy\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"112\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"119\" /><option startIndex=\"120\" endIndex=\"127\" /><option startIndex=\"128\" endIndex=\"138\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameObject\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(x, y) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".x = x;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".y = y;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameObject\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameObject\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemy1);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player1);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>class</code>, gefolgt von <code>Player</code> und schließlich <code>extends</code>, <code>GameObject</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 150066,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Erstelle eine Instanz der <code>Player</code>-Klasse und zeige die <code>health</code>-Eigenschaft an.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Character\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"120\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"133\" /><option startIndex=\"146\" endIndex=\"157\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Character\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Character\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hero = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hero.health);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>const</code>, gefolgt von <code>hero</code> und schließlich <code>= new</code>, <code>Player(100);</code>, <code>hero.health</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 150067,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Erstelle eine <code>move()</code>-Methode und rufe sie über die <code>Player</code>-Instanz auf.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Player\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"124\" endIndex=\"125\" /><option startIndex=\"190\" endIndex=\"194\" /><option startIndex=\"194\" endIndex=\"202\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Character\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(speed) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".speed = speed;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" move() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;moving at speed &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".speed);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Character\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hero = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hero.move();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>move() {</code>, gefolgt von <code>}</code> und schließlich <code>hero</code>, <code>.move();</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 150068,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code einen Methodennamen und Parameter, um die Methode in der <code>Mage</code>-Klasse zu überschreiben, die in der <code>Hero</code>-Klasse vorhanden ist.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"126\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Hero\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(amount + \" /><text value=\"&quot; damage taken&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Mage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Hero\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (amount &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;magic shield reduces &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + amount + \" /><text value=\"&quot; damage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>takeDamage(amount)</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 150069,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rufe die <code>takeDamage()</code>-Methode mit <code>10</code> auf, um zu sehen, was passiert.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"249\" endIndex=\"270\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Hero\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(amount + \" /><text value=\"&quot; damage taken&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Mage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Hero\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (amount === \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;magic shield reduces &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + amount + \" /><text value=\"&quot; damage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mage1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Mage();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mage1.takeDamage(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>mage1.takeDamage(10);</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 150070,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rufe die <code>takeDamage()</code>-Methode auf einem <code>hero1</code> und <code>mage1</code> auf, um ihr unterschiedliches Verhalten zu sehen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Mage\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"249\" endIndex=\"254\" /><option startIndex=\"254\" endIndex=\"270\" /><option startIndex=\"297\" endIndex=\"302\" /><option startIndex=\"302\" endIndex=\"318\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Hero\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(amount + \" /><text value=\"&quot; damage taken&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Mage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Hero\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (amount === \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;magic shield reduces &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + amount + \" /><text value=\"&quot; damage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hero1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Hero();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hero1.takeDamage(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mage1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Mage();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mage1.takeDamage(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>hero1</code>, gefolgt von <code>.takeDamage(10);</code> und schließlich <code>mage1</code>, <code>.takeDamage(10);</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 150071,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wähle das Code-Snippet, das die <code>attack()</code>-Methode der <code>Weapon</code>-Klasse aufruft.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"attack(damage);\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"151\" endIndex=\"172\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Weapon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack(damage) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(damage + \" /><text value=\"&quot; damage dealt&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sword\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Weapon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack(damage) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (damage === \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".attack(damage);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>super.attack(damage);</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 150072,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist falsch an diesem Code?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Weapon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack(damage) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(damage + \" /><text value=\"&quot; damage dealt&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sword\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Weapon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack(damage) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  Super.attack(damage);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>super</code> wird großgeschrieben; es sollte <code>super.attack(damage);</code> sein.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Es gibt nichts Falsches am Code</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Unterklassen sollten <code>super()</code> nicht aufrufen</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>super</code> wird großgeschrieben; es sollte <code>super.attack(damage);</code> sein..</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 150073,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie viele Parameter sollte die <code>super()</code>-Methode haben, wenn sie aufgerufen wird?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Die gleiche Anzahl von Parametern wie der Konstruktor der Superklasse</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Keine</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Soviel die Unterklasse benötigt</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Die gleiche Anzahl von Parametern wie der Konstruktor der Superklasse.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 150074,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Füge einen Aufruf zu <code>super</code> hinzu, um den Konstruktor der <code>Sprite</code>-Klasse mit <code>imagePath</code> aufzurufen. Vergiss das Semikolon <code>;</code> nicht.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"140\" endIndex=\"157\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(imagePath) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".imagePath = imagePath;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"PlayerSprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(imagePath) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(imagePath);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>super(imagePath);</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 150075,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verwende <code>this</code>, um eine <code>weapon</code>-Eigenschaft zu erstellen, die den Wert des <code>weapon</code>-Parameters speichert.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(imagePath) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".imagePath = imagePath;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"PlayerSprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(imagePath, weapon) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(imagePath);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".weapon = weapon;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"168\" endIndex=\"189\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>this.weapon = weapon;</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 150076,
